"translated in a speacial way.Please see http://edu.kde.org/kturtle/"
"translator.php to learn know how to properly translate it."
msgid ""
"# Example: %1\n"
"# This example draws some nice curving shapes...\n"
"\n"
"@(reset)\n"
"@(penup)\n"
"@(forward) 50\n"
"@(pendown)\n"
"\n"
"@(repeat) 4 {\n"
